  wording was applied to BOTH devices, and the television's badge column is 48dp at 8sp: "DIRECT"
  fitted, "INSTANT" did not. It shipped reading "IN-", with the rest of the word off the edge.

  Same fact, shorter words. Both fit the column with room to spare.
-->
